  "preambleHtml": "",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>Although <strong>The Highway Code</strong> shows many of the signs commonly in use, a comprehensive explanation of our signing system is given in the Department’s booklet <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/know-your-traffic-signs\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Know Your Traffic Signs</a>, which is on sale at booksellers. The booklet also illustrates and explains the vast majority of signs the road user is likely to encounter.</p>\n\n<p>The signs illustrated in <strong>The Highway Code</strong> are not all drawn to the same scale. In Wales, bilingual versions of some signs are used including Welsh and English versions of place names. Some older designs of signs may still be seen on the roads.</p>\n\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68f8d5c5ec6267c615ed8f99/the-highway-code-traffic-signs.pdf\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download ‘Traffic signs’ (PDF, 821KB)</a></p>\n</div>\n\nSigns giving orders\n\n<p><strong>Signs with red circles are mostly prohibitive. Plates below signs qualify their message.</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f29740f0b6151f000013/sign-giving-order-entry-20-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Entry to 20 mph zone (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/57f76285e5274a0eb7000029/sign-giving-order-end-20-zonev2.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ End of 20 mph zone (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f2dd40f0b6151f000015/sign-giving-order-maximum-speed.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Maximum speed (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f2f740f0b6151c00001d/sign-giving-order-national-speed-limit.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ National speed limit applies (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f31040f0b6151f000017/sign-giving-order-school-crossing-patrol.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ School crossing patrol (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f330e5274a151e000022/sign-giving-order-stop-give-way.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Stop and give way (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f373ed915d155f00001e/sign-giving-order-give-way.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Give way to traffic on major road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f3d040f0b6151c00001f/sign-giving-order-manually-stop.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Manually operated temporary STOP and GO signs (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f3f1e5274a152100001f/sign-giving-order-manually-go.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Manually operated temporary STOP and GO signs (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f41b40f0b6151f000019/sign-giving-order-no-entry-vehicular-traffic.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No entry for vehicular traffic (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f489e5274a151e000024/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicles except bicycles being pushed (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4a5ed915d155c00000f/sign-giving-order-no-cycling.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No cycling (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4d840f0b6151f00001b/sign-giving-order-no-motor-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No motor vehicles (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4f0ed915d155f000020/sign-giving-order-no-buses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No buses (over 8 passenger seats) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f50240f0b6151c000021/sign-giving-order-no-overtaking.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No overtaking (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f52540f0b6151c000023/sign-giving-order-no-towed-caravans.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No towed caravans (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f562e5274a1521000021/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-carry-explosives.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicles carrying explosives (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/58171318e5274a03bd000004/sign-giving-order-no-vehicle-combination-length.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicle or combination of vehicles over length shown (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f5dc40f0b6151c000025/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-over-height.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicles over height shown (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f60aed915d155f000022/sign-giving-order-no-vehicle-width.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicles over width shown (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f637e5274a151e000026/sign-giving-order-give-priority-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Give priority to vehicles from opposite direction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f66fe5274a151e000028/sign-giving-order-no-right-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No right turn (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f68740f0b6151f000021/sign-giving-order-no-left-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No left turn (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f6aded915d155f000024/sign-giving-order-no-u-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No U-turns (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f6d8e5274a151e00002a/sign-giving-order-no-goods-vehicle-over-weight.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No goods vehicles over maximum gross weight shown (in tonnes) except for loading and unloading (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9ffe8e5274a151e00002c/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-max-gross-weight.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No vehicles over maximum gross weight shown (in tonnes) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba0058ed915d155c000011/sign-giving-order-park-restrict-permit-holders.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Parking restricted to permit holders (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba0070e5274a151e00002e/sign-giving-order-red-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No stopping during period indicated except for buses (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba008eed915d155f000028/sign-giving-order-no-stopping-times.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No stopping during times shown except for as long as necessary to set down or pick up passengers (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba00a140f0b6151f000025/sign-giving-order-no-waiting.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No waiting (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba00b540f0b6151c000027/sign-giving-order-no-stopping.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No stopping (Clearway) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nSigns with blue circles but no red border mostly give positive instruction.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55cb16d9e5274a5473000021/sign-giving-order-ahead-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Ahead only (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba11ffe5274a151e000030/sign-giving-order-turn-left-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Turn left ahead (right if symbol reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1211ed915d155c000017/sign-giving-order-turn-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Turn left (right if symbol reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba123bed915d155c000019/sign-giving-order-keep-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Keep left (right if symbol reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba124eed915d155c00001b/sign-giving-order-vehicle-pass-either-side.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Vehicles may pass either side to reach same destination (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba126540f0b6151c00002b/sign-giving-order-mini-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Mini-roundabout (roundabout circulation - give way to vehicles from the immediate right) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1284e5274a1521000023/sign-giving-order-route-pedal-cycles-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Route to be used by pedal cycles only (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12b1ed915d155c00001d/sign-giving-order-segregated-cycle-pedestrian-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Segregated pedal cycle and pedestrian route (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12c140f0b6151f000027/sign-giving-order-minimum-speed.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Minimum speed (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12d3e5274a151e000032/sign-giving-order-minimum-speed-end.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ End of minimum speed (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68e3cbcc49e17d00a56ffe3c/sign-giving-order-buses-cycles-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Buses and cycles only (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68e3cbba8c1db6022d0ca152/sign-giving-order-trams-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Trams only (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba131840f0b6151c00002d/sign-giving-order-pedestrian-crossing-tramway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Pedestrian crossing point over tramway (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba132ee5274a151e000036/sign-giving-order-one-way-traffic.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ One-way traffic (note: compare circular ‘Ahead only’ sign) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1353e5274a1521000027/sign-giving-order-with-flow-bus-cycle-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ With-flow bus and cycle lane (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba136ded915d155f00002a/sign-giving-order-contra-flow-bus-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Contra-flow bus lane (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1383ed915d155c00001f/sign-giving-order-with-flow-pedal-cycle-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ With-flow pedal cycle lane (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nWarning signs\n\nMostly triangular\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75e26ed915d07e2000007/warning-sign-distance-to-stop-line-ahead-100-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Distance to ‘STOP’ line ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75e47e5274a215200000c/warning-sign-dual-carriageway-ends.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Dual carriageway ends (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75eeded915d07fe000005/warning-sign-road-narrow.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Road narrows on right (left if symbol reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75f15ed915d07fe000007/warning-sign-road-narrow-both-sides.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Road narrows on both sides (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75f36e5274a215200000e/warning-sign-distance-to-stop-line-ahead-50-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Distance to ‘Give Way’ line ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7696640f0b6790f000011/warning-sign-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Crossroads (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7698540f0b6790f000013/warning-sign-junction-on-bend-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Junction on bend ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b769b2ed915d07e200000b/warning-sign-t-junction-with-priority.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ T-junction with priority over vehicles from the right (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b769e040f0b67aa300000d/warning-sign-staggered-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Staggered junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a04ed915d07fe000009/warning-sign-traffic-merging-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic merging from left ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><strong>The priority through route is indicated by the broader line.</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a2d40f0b6790f000015/warning-sign-double-bend.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Double bend first to left (symbol may be reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a5d40f0b67aa300000f/warning-sign-bend-to-right.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Bend to right (or left if symbol reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a79ed915d07fe00000b/warning-sign-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Roundabout (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a9240f0b6790f000017/warning-sign-uneven-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Uneven road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ab240f0b67aa3000011/warning-sign-plate-below-some-signs.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Plate below some signs (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76af8ed915d07fe00000d/warning-sign-two-way-traffic-crosses-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Two-way traffic crosses one-way road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b1e40f0b67aa3000013/warning-sign-two-way-traffic-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Two-way traffic straight ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b42e5274a21ec00000a/warning-sign-swing-bridge.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Opening or swing bridge ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b6840f0b67aa3000015/warning-sign-aircraft.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Low-flying aircraft or sudden aircraft noise (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b81ed915d07fe00000f/warning-sign-falling-rocks.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Falling or fallen rocks (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bbbed915d07fe000011/warning-sign-traffic-signals-not-in-use.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic signals not in use (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bd2e5274a21ec00000c/warning-sign-traffic-signals.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic signals (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bec40f0b6790f000019/warning-sign-slippery-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Slippery road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c11ed915d07fe000013/warning-sign-steep-hill-downwards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Steep hill downwards (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c2de5274a21ec00000e/warning-sign-steep-hill-upwards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Steep hill upwards (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><strong>Gradients may be shown as a ratio i.e. 20% = 1:5</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c51e5274a21ec000010/warning-sign-tunnel-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Tunnel ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c82ed915d07fe000015/warning-sign-trams-crossing-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Trams crossing ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ca6e5274a2152000010/warning-sign-level-crossing-ahead-barrier-or-gate.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Level crossing with barrier or gate ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76cf940f0b67aa3000017/warning-sign-level-crossing-ahead-without-barrier.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Level crossing without barrier or gate ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76d18ed915d07e200000d/warning-sign-level-crossing-without-barrier-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Level crossing without barrier (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76da940f0b67aa3000019/warning-sign-school-crossing-patrol-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ School crossing patrol ahead (some signs have amber lights which flash when crossings are in use) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ddc40f0b6790f00001b/warning-sign-frail-pedestrians-cross-road-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Frail (or blind or disabled if shown) pedestrians likely to cross road ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76dfbed915d07fe000017/warning-sign-pedestrians-in-road-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Pedestrians in road ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76e1040f0b6790f00001d/warning-sign-zebra-crossing.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Zebra crossing (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5817085d40f0b64c34000000/warning-sign-overhead-electric-cables.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Overhead electric cable; plate indicates maximum height of vehicles which can pass safely (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76e75e5274a2152000012/warning-sign-available-width-head-room.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Available width of headroom indicated (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ecae5274a21ec000014/warning-sign-sharp-deviation-of-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Sharp deviation of route to left (or right if chevrons reversed) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ef9e5274a21ec000016/warning-sign-light-signals-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Light signals ahead at level crossing, airfield or bridge (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f4440f0b6790f00001f/warning-sign-level-crossing-minature.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Miniature warning lights at level crossings (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f56e5274a21ec000018/warning-sign-cattle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Cattle (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f70e5274a21ec00001a/warning-sign-wild-animals.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Wild animals (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f87ed915d07fe000019/warning-sign-wild-horses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Wild horses or ponies (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fa6ed915d07fe00001b/warning-sign-accompanied-horses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Accompanied horses or ponies (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fbced915d07e200000f/warning-sign-cycle-route-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Cycle route ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fd9e5274a2152000014/warning-sign-risk-of-ice.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Risk of ice (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ffa40f0b6790f000021/warning-sign-traffic-queues.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic queues likely ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7701940f0b6790f000023/warning-sign-distance-humps-extend.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Distance over which road humps extend (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7703fe5274a21ec00001c/warning-sign-other-danger.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Other danger; plate indicates nature of danger (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b77056ed915d07fe00001d/warning-sign-soft-verges.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Soft verges (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7706940f0b67aa300001b/warning-sign-side-winds.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Side winds (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7707ae5274a21ec00001e/warning-sign-hump-bridge.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Hump bridge (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7708fed915d07fe00001f/warning-sign-worded-sign-ford.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Worded warning sign (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b770aaed915d07fe000021/warning-sign-quayside-or-riverbank.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Quayside or river bank (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b770c3ed915d07fe000023/warning-sign-risk-of-grounding.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Risk of grounding (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nDirection signs\n\nMostly rectangular\n\nSigns on motorways - blue backgrounds\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a448e5274a1521000001/direction-sign-blue-junction-leading-to-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ At a junction leading directly into a motorway (junction number may be shown on a black background) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a47b40f0b6151c000001/direction-sign-blue-approach-to-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approaches to junctions (junction number on black background) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a49e40f0b6151f000001/direction-sign-blue-route-sign.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Route confirmatory sign after junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a4c0ed915d155c000005/direction-sign-blue-get-in-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Downward pointing arrows mean ‘Get in lane’ The left-hand lane leads to a different destination from the other lanes. (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a4e940f0b6151c000003/direction-sign-blue-destination-leaving-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ The panel with the inclined arrow indicates the destinations which can be reached by leaving the motorway at the next junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nSigns on primary routes - green backgrounds\n\n<p>Blue panels indicate that the motorway starts at the junction ahead.\nMotorways shown in brackets can also be reached along the route indicated. White panels indicate local or non-primary routes leading from the junction ahead.\nBrown panels show the route to tourist attractions.\nThe name of the junction may be shown at the top of the sign.\nThe aircraft symbol indicates the route to an airport.\nA symbol may be included to warn of a hazard or restriction along that route.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a74fed915d155c000007/direction-sign-green-approach-junction-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approaches to junctions (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/581715bded915d61c5000007/direction-sign-green-at-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ At the junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7afed915d155f000003/direction-sign-green-route-sign.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Route confirmatory sign after junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7cce5274a1521000003/direction-sign-green-approach-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approaches to junctions (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7e7e5274a151e000001/direction-sign-green-billingual.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approach to a junction in Wales (bilingual) (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a812e5274a1521000005/direction-sign-green-ring-road-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Primary route forming part of a ring road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a82ce5274a151e000003/direction-sign-green-primary-route-ring-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Primary route forming part of a ring road (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nSigns on non-primary and local routes - black borders\n\n<p>Green panels indicate that the primary route starts at the junction ahead. Route numbers on a blue background show the direction to a motorway. Route numbers on a green background show the direction to a primary route.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aeabed915d155f000005/direction-sign-black-border-approach-junction-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approaches to junctions (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aec7ed915d155f000007/direction-sign-black-border-approach-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ On approaches to junctions (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aef1e5274a151e00000f/direction-sign-black-border-at-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ At the junction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8af1540f0b6151c000007/direction-sign-black-border-toilets-disabled-access.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Direction to toilets with access for the disabled (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nOther direction signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a938e5274a1521000007/direction-sign-other-picnic-site.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Picnic site (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a952e5274a151e000005/direction-sign-other-english-heritage.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Ancient monument in the care of English Heritage (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a965e5274a151e000007/direction-sign-other-direction-car-park.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Direction to a car park (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a98740f0b6151f000005/direction-sign-other-tourist-attraction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Tourist attraction (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a9a140f0b6151f000007/direction-sign-other-camping-caravan.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Direction to camping and caravan site (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a9b9e5274a151e000009/direction-sign-other-advisory-route-lorries.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Advisory route for lorries (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab18e5274a1521000009/direction-sign-other-route-pedal-cycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Route for pedal cycles forming part of a network (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab49e5274a151e00000b/direction-sign-other-recommended-route-cycle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Recommended route for pedal cycles to place shown (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab66e5274a152100000b/direction-sign-other-route-pedestrians.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Route for pedestrians (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab86ed915d155c000009/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-square.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Symbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abace5274a151e00000d/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-triangle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Symbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abc2e5274a152100000d/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-diamond.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Symbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abd6e5274a152100000f/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-circle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Symbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abf540f0b6151c000005/direction-sign-other-diversion-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Diversion route (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nInformation signs\n\nAll rectangular\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bc8040f0b6151c000009/Information-sign-entrance-controlled-parking-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Entrance to controlled parking zone (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bc98ed915d155f000009/Information-sign-entrance-congestion-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Entrance to congestion charging zone (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcab40f0b6151c00000b/Information-sign-end-controlled-parking-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ End of controlled parking zone (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcc340f0b6151c00000d/Information-sign-advance-warning-restriction-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Advance warning of restriction or prohibition ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcdfed915d155f00000b/Information-sign-parking-place-solo-motorcycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Parking place for solo motorcycles (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcf4e5274a151e000013/Information-sign-with-flow-bus-lane-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ With-flow bus lane ahead which pedal cycles and taxis may also use (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd2aed915d155c00000b/Information-sign-lane-for-hov.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Diagram (online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p>Lane designated for use by high occupancy vehicles (HOV) - see <a href=\"/code/rule/142\">rule 142</a></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd4140f0b6151c00000f/Information-sign-vehicles-permitted-HOV-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Vehicles permitted to use an HOV lane ahead (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd5b40f0b6151f000009/Information-sign-motorway-end.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ End of motorway (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd6fe5274a151e000015/Information-sign-start-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Start of motorway and point from which motorway regulations apply (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd89e5274a