ugh these will be erected at equal distances the bars do not represent 100 yard intervals. (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8beb3ed915d155f000011/Information-sign-motorway-service.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Motorway service area sign showing the operator’s name (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8befce5274a151e000017/Information-sign-traffic-priority-over-oncoming-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic has priority over oncoming vehicles (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c000ed915d155f000014/Information-sign-hospital-a-and-e.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Hospital ahead with Accident and Emergency facilities (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c01340f0b6151c000015/Information-sign-tourist-info-point.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Tourist information point (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c026e5274a1521000015/Information-sign-no-through-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ No through road for vehicles (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c063e5274a151e00001a/Information-sign-recommended-route-cycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Recommended route for pedal cycles (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c079e5274a1521000017/Information-sign-home-zone-entry.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Home Zone Entry (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\